# Desert Were-Worm: the total power that counts is the power of the creatures as they were declared (the ruling): on turn 5 the
# Worm (6/5 with three Mountains) and a Cyclops of One-Eyed Pass (5/2) attack for a total of 11 - one short - and Smaug's Fury,
# cast on the Cyclops once the attackers are declared (+3, total 14 now), is too late. There is no trigger, so no untap and no
# additional combat phase: Bot2 (40 life) takes 6 + 5 + 3 = 14, and the Worm is still tapped afterwards.

